I swear to God,
I was doing so well!

727
00:41:24,941 --> 00:41:27,569
Goin' to class on time.
I must be dumb as hell.

728
00:41:27,653 --> 00:41:30,280
Real dumb thinking that
the Princess of Wakanda

729
00:41:30,364 --> 00:41:32,032
