Hey. Namor sank an entire ship
of CIA operatives...

735
00:41:45,045 --> 00:41:46,463
<i>FBI</i> AGENT: <i>(ON SPEAKER)
This is the Federal Bureau</i>

736
00:41:46,546 --> 00:41:47,547
<i>of Investigation.</i>

737
00:41:47,631 --> 00:41:48,674
