SHURI: That's awesome.

760
00:42:34,511 --> 00:42:35,804
<i>FBI AGENT: We have
a warrant to detain...</i>

761
00:42:35,887 --> 00:42:37,639
<i>- SHURI: Come.
- ...the student Riri Williams.</i>

762
